  <enumValues uuid="11bbae26-5f86-42bc-840f-afc613835f99">
    <name>PaymentsToOwnersDueToPurchaseOfTheirStockSharesOrCessationOfMembership</name>
    <synonym>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Payments to owners due to purchase of their stock (shares) or cessation of membership</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>پرداخت‌ها به مالکان به دلیل خرید سهام آن‌ها یا خاتمه عضویت</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Pagamenti ai titolari relativi all'acquisto di loro azioni (quote) o uscita dei titolari dalla compartecipazione</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Płatności od właścicieli (uczestników) w związku z umorzeniem udziałów od nich (udziałów w uczestnictwie) organizacji lub ich wycofaniem z listy uczestników</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Платежи собственникам в связи с выкупом у них акций (долей) или их выходом из состава участников</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Hisse senetlerinin (paylarının) satın alınmasıyla veya üyelikten çekilmeleriyle bağlantılı olarak sahiplerine yapılan ödemeler</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Tiền chi trả vốn góp cho các chủ sở hữu, mua lại cổ phiếu của doanh nghiệp đã phát hành</value>
    </synonym>
  </enumValues>
  <enumValues uuid="08293188-6b6b-47c7-8d90-43f6dc6d2acd">
